%[text] # Regression Basics
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_E8C62B23] ## Scripts
%[text] ### [Linear Regression](file:./Scripts/LinearRegression.m) and [Practice Linear](file:./Scripts/TryRegression.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,520,253],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | ![Scatter plot with fit and residuals.](text:image:4216) | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} explain and apply simple linear regression models.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} evaluate and interpret regression results using residuals and model coefficients.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} build multiple linear regression models and assess model fit using visual and analytical methods.</p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Math</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Statistics</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Data Science</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Biomedical Devices</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Machine Learning</p> |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text:table]
%[text] ### [Curvilinear Regression](file:./Scripts/CurvilinearRegression.m) and [Practice Polynomial](file:./Scripts/TryCurvilinearPolynomial.m) and [Practice Linearizable Nonlinear](file:./Scripts/TryCurvilinear.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[180,-1,-1],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | <p></p><p>![Illustration of a rechargable battery](text:image:15cd)</p> | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} explain curvilinear regression and when to use it.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} distinguish and apply polynomial and linearizable nonlinear models.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} explain curvilinear regression and identify contexts where it is most suitable.</p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Math</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Statistics</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Data Science</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Machine Learning</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Electrochemistry/Chemical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Electrical Engineering</p> |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text:table]
%[text] ### [Multiple Regression](file:./Scripts/MultipleRegression.m) and [Practice Multiple](file:./Scripts/TryMultiple.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[181,501,274],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | <p></p><p>![3D scatter plot of house prices](text:image:2d24)</p> | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} explain multiple linear regression and identify response and predictor variables.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} check linearity assumptions using scatterplots and residual diagnostics.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} fit and use a multiple regression model to interpret coefficients and make predictions.</p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Math</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Statistics</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Data Science</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Machine Learning</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Chemical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Electrical Engineering</p> |
